commit: a3cbc32f01da8c451490aeb0a2c4a2a072caa9e3

{"body":"Choose an Entry now closes with the shared ✕, the way every other form does, and this PR answers what Where's Back does with the selection.\n\n### What changed\n\n`App/LogDose/ReadingChoiceView.swift` had a hand-built \"Cancel\" text button in its `.cancellationAction` item. It is replaced by the catalog's `discardConfirmation(hasChanges: false, cancelID: \"reading-cancel\", close: { dismiss() })`. With `hasChanges: false` it closes at once and never asks. The id `reading-cancel` stays, so the existing UI tests that tap it are untouched. Nothing else on the sheet changes.\n\n### Where's Back\n\nWhere's Back returns to New Entry with both places still selected, and Back is unchanged. Where edits the New Entry draft through a binding, so there is nothing for Back to discard. I walked it on the `spread` seed: picked Tailbone and Ribs in Where, tapped Back, and New Entry's \"More places\" row read \"Tailbone and Ribs\".\n\n### Shared pieces used\n\n`discardConfirmation` from `App/Design`, which draws the ✕ and speaks \"Cancel\". No shared piece was added and no Cancel item, text button or dialog of our own remains on the sheet.\n\n### Look check\n\nThe brief names no design picture. I compared by eye in light and in dark against New Entry's and Log Dose's ✕, which come from the same piece, and measured the control from `axe describe-ui`.\n\n| Control | Design | Mine | Match |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Close control | system ✕ in the leading place, as on New Entry | system ✕ in a round glass capsule, 36 pt, leading, in light and dark | yes |\n| Old \"Cancel\" capsule | gone | gone | yes |\n| Spoken label | \"Cancel\" | `reading-cancel` is labelled \"Cancel\" | yes |\n| ✕ colour | brand red in light, light red in dark, as on New Entry | same in both | yes |\n\n### Walks\n\nRun in my own simulator, iPhone 17 Pro on iOS 26.5, with a private data folder.\n\n- `choose-entry-close` on `basdai-rows`: from Log Dose, `before-reading-row` opens the sheet. The top bar shows a ✕ at the leading place and no text capsule. `reading-cancel` is `Button`, label \"Cancel\", frame 36 x 36 at x 20, y 92. Tapping it closes the sheet at once, and the tree has no `discard-changes` and no Choose an Entry ids afterwards.\n- `back-answer` on `spread`: as above.\n\n### Left alone\n\n`LogDoseView` and the Edit Dose trash are task 01.\n"}
